<div class="about-values">
  <div class="about-values__inner">
    <div class="about-values__header">
      <div class="about-values__eyebrow">
        <span>04 / WHAT WE BELIEVE</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="about-values__title">
        CLIMB<br>
        <span>YOUR WAY.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="about-values__intro">
        THERE'S NO SINGLE WAY TO CLIMB. WE'RE HERE TO CREATE A SPACE WHERE EVERYONE CAN FIND THE STYLE, PACE, AND
        COMMUNITY THAT WORKS FOR THEM.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values__list">
      <article class="about-values__item">
        <span class="about-values__number">01</span>

        <div class="about-values__content">
          <h3>PEOPLE FIRST</h3>
          <p>
            Climbing is better together. We build a community where beginners, regulars, and experienced climbers all
            have a place.
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="about-values__arrow">↗</span>
      </article>

      <article class="about-values__item">
        <span class="about-values__number">02</span>

        <div class="about-values__content">
          <h3>PROGRESS OVER PERFECTION</h3>
          <p>
            Every climb counts. We celebrate the small wins, the projects that take time, and everything you learn along
            the way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="about-values__arrow">↗</span>
      </article>

      <article class="about-values__item">
        <span class="about-values__number">03</span>

        <div class="about-values__content">
          <h3>STAY CURIOUS</h3>
          <p>
            Try a new problem. Learn a new technique. Find a different way up. There's always something new to discover.
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="about-values__arrow">↗</span>
      </article>

      <article class="about-values__item">
        <span class="about-values__number">04</span>

        <div class="about-values__content">
          <h3>HAVE FUN</h3>
          <p>Climbing should challenge you, but it should also make you want to come back tomorrow.</p>
        </div>

        <span class="about-values__arrow">↗</span>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values__footer">
      <span>CLIMB / CONNECT / PROGRESS</span>
      <span>ESC-ALA</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .about-values {
    width: 100%;
    background: #f2f0e9;
    color: #0b0f2b;
  }

  .about-values__inner {
    width: min(1400px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 120px 0 32px;
  }

  .about-values__header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px;
    column-gap: 48px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 90px;
  }

  .about-values__eyebrow {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .about-values__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(76px, 11vw, 170px);
    line-height: 0.78;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-values__title span {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #ffc107;
  }

  .about-values__intro {
    max-width: 300px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .about-values__list {
    border-top: 2px solid #0b0f2b;
  }

  .about-values__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0, 1fr) 40px;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 15, 43, 0.3);
    transition: padding-left 180ms ease;
  }

  .about-values__item:hover {
    padding-left: 14px;
  }

  .about-values__number {
    padding-top: 5px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .about-values__content h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 44px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .about-values__content p {
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about-values__arrow {
    justify-self: end;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-values__footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 18px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .about-values__inner {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
      padding: 88px 0 24px;
    }

    .about-values__header {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .about-values__eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .about-values__title {
      font-size: clamp(64px, 18vw, 105px);
    }

    .about-values__intro {
      max-width: 280px;
      margin-top: 32px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .about-values__item {
      grid-template-columns: 38px minmax(0, 1fr) 24px;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 26px 0;
    }

    .about-values__item:hover {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .about-values__content h3 {
      font-size: 25px;
      line-height: 0.95;
    }

    .about-values__content p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .about-values__arrow {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .about-values__footer {
      font-size: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Values",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "About Values"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
